-- SECTION 5: THE MIDDLE WAY OUT OF HALTING — NATIVE `codata` PRODUCTIVE FIXED POINT
--   Guarded corecursion (`codata VxProdFix`, verified by `chk-codef` in `lib/check`)
--   guarantees EVERY finite horizon terminates productively in O(1) step work,
